// AWS IAM Managed Policy Attached to Role  [tier: hunt]  ATT&CK: T1098.003
// Detects attachment of a managed policy to an IAM role (AttachRolePolicy). A common privilege-escalation step, especially when the role is…
// False positives: Routine role permission changes by platform teams.
// Source: rules/privilege-escalation/iam-attach-role-policy.yml — generated by scripts/build_dist.py; adjust field names to your CloudTrail schema.
eventName =~ "AttachRolePolicy" and eventSource =~ "iam.amazonaws.com"
